{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-06-30 09:00:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL COMMODITY INSIGHTS JOINS WITH PEXAPARK TO CREATE NEW BENCHMARK FOR RENEWABLE ENERGY PRICING', 'text': "CO-BRANDED INDICES TO FURTHER PRICE TRANSPARENCY AND RISK ASSESSMENT IN THE RENEWABLE ENERGY MARKETS NEW YORK , JUNE 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL COMMODITY INSIGHTS, THE LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF INFORMATION AND BENCHMARK PRICES FOR THE COMMODITIES AND ENERGY MARKETS, AND PEXAPARK, THE LEADING PROVIDER OF REFERENCE PRICING, ENTERPRISE SOFTWARE AND EXECUTION SERVICES FOR RENEWABLE POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENTS (PPAS),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT TO CREATE JOINTLY RENEWABLE ENERGY PRICE INDICES TO HELP CREATE MORE TRANSPARENCY IN RENEWABLE ENERGY MARKETS. THE COLLABORATION WILL COMBINE PLATTS BENCHMARK\xa0EXPERTISE WITH PEXAPARK'S TRUSTED REFERENCE PRICING OF RENEWABLE PPAS ACROSS EUROPEAN MARKETS."}